title: $:/nikorion/language/en-GB/Playground/

Intro: The integration wiki of the //kms// suite: every plugin of the suite loaded together, on a few demo tiddlers — the ontology defines the fields, Base Fields edits them, Dynamic Table lays them out as columns.
TableHeading: ! The demo tiddlers, in a table
TableBody: Each column is a field of the ontology, with its label as header and its values shown with their icons and labels. Click the pencil in the caption to edit them in place: dropdowns for the vocabularies, checkboxes for Needs, the Base Fields picker for the lists.
EditorHeading: ! In the editor
EditorBody: Open any of them and edit it to see the same fields in the tiddler editor. //Old Plugin Layout// still holds a `status`, which a reference does not use: the editor shows it framed in red.
OntologyHeading: ! The ontology
OntologyBody: The //Fields// tab of the KMS Ontology plugin lists every field and every value, with what it means.
